<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0647_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Blue</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wha... I can’t make out what you\nsayin’! This connection is TRASH!\rCall from somewhere better.\nI only take calls in HD.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup...\nWhatever... Don’t worry about me.\fI’m doin’ PEACHY over here!\fTotally not thinkin’ about Red.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There any Block Bosses you ain’t\nscrapped yet?\fMake your move! Show some initiative!\fLike me. I’m all initiative.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If it ain’t Sunday night, I ain’t\navailable.\fCall then or forget it!\fI’m VERY busy. Doin’ stuff.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I was just lookin’ for somethin’ to do!\nNot that I’m bored. I’m never bored.\fWanna scrap me again? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whatever!\nI ain’t losin’ to you again, got that?\rI’ll be waitin’ at the Saffron Dojo.\nI’m already winnin’. In my head.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whatever. Sound like you pretty busy\nyourself.\fI ain’t hurt. I’m never hurt.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wha...?\nOh, c’mon... Ain’t you made plans\fwith enough other people?\fYou more popular than me? Impossible.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m waitin’ at the Saffron Dojo.\fC’mon, show a lil initiative!\fSmell ya there!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m Blue.\nYou know. THE Blue.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Remember we made plans to scrap at\nthe Saffron Dojo?\fWha...! You FORGOT?\fNobody forgets ME! C’mon!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When I look at homies, I get a weird\nfeelin’--you ever get that?\rRound ones, square ones,\nflyin’ ones, swimmin’ ones,\fflamin’ ones, freezin’ ones,\fshiny ones, dark ones...\fSO many types, and they all homies.\rLike people, I guess.\nThere ain’t just one type.\rThere’s just one BEST type. Me.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Anyway, you somethin’ else.\rTravelin’ by yourself, hittin’ all\nthese Blocks, beatin’ ’em all...\rWell, you ain’t REALLY alone...\nYou got homies with you!\fI’m not jealous. Why would I be.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0647_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Man, this guy Red took me out in a\nheartbeat.\rI ain’t seen him in a minute...\nI wonder where he at...\fNot that I care. I don’t care.\rCome to think of it, you look a lil\nlike Red. Yeah, you do.\rJust... a lil bit. Whatever...\fI’m hangin’ up. I ain’t sad.</language>
	</row>
</body>
